2025</span></span></p><h1 class="post__title" data-v-e174a07f>AI &amp; automation at Evri</h1></header><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvByUMqNJQqHmbo_ConsumerusingAI5237.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvByUMqNJQqHmbo_ConsumerusingAI.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvByUMqNJQqHmbo_ConsumerusingAI.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvByUMqNJQqHmbo_ConsumerusingAI.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A woman wearing an orange blazer is sitting at a desk in front of an open laptop, holding a tablet and pressing the screen with her other hand. There are digitalized symbols in white overlaying the photo to show she is using AI technology" width="960" height="640" class="post__featured-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e174a07f><section class="post__content" data-v-e174a07f><div data-v-e174a07f><!--[--><section id="after-evri’s-announcement-in-2024-about-a-£1m-investment-in-automation,-we’re-pleased-to-introduce-you-to-our-new-⁠ai-&amp;-automation-page-that-will-share-updates-about-our-journey-so-far,-some-highlights-on-what-has-been-achieved,-and-how-it-benefits-our-clients,-customers,-couriers-and-colleagues.-we-will-be-providing-regular-updates-to-this-page-as-we-continue-to-safely-navigate-new-ways-of-operating-with-the-enhanced-offering-that-ai-brings-to-our-business." class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->After Evri’s announcement in 2024 about a £1m investment in automation, we’re pleased to introduce you to our new ⁠<!--]--><!--]--><a href="/ai-and-automation" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->AI &amp; automation page<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> that will share updates about our journey so far, some highlights on what has been achieved, and how it benefits our clients, customers, couriers and colleagues. We will be providing regular updates to this page as we continue to safely navigate new ways of operating with the enhanced offering that AI brings to our business.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have recruited an internal automation centre of excellence team, that focuses on supporting Evri to deliver key priorities using technologies to automate repetitive and high-volume tasks, building low-code applications to improve speed to market, and we’re also responsible for exploring advanced AI technologies as we look to continue our journey as the biggest dedicated parcel delivery company.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The team has provided significant business benefits and supports our Delivering Better campaign, comprising initiatives focusing on operational excellence, transforming operations and, specifically, improving customer experience (our most successful automation – <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/customer-service-response-and-wrap-up-use-case" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->customer service response and wrap-up<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->).<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With the ever-changing AI market, we have put a robust governance and framework wrap around anything we are looking at connected with AI. We have mobilised an AI forum, which consists of key representation from architecture, service, security, data, innovation, automation and legal, which provides us with the assurance that anything we are exploring has the necessary support from across key business areas. We have created our AI policy, and this is at the forefront of any new idea that comes through the new ideas stage. Lastly, we have created an AI register to ensure we have a central location for everything we are exploring, implementing and building across the various business areas.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section id="ai-and-automation" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner" index="1" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>AI and automation</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;re safely implementing AI to deliver better for our people, customers, clients and couriers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out the latest news and updates about exciting projects we&#39;ve been working on and more.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link feature-banner__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find out more" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/ai-and-automation" data-v-054940bd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find out more<!--]--></span></a></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration93e3.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A human and robot index finger are shown to meet in the middle of the photo" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="rich_text" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="2" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– End –<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> is one of the UK’s dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering more than 800 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites. The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 25,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which surpass 99%, an average courier rating of 4.7/5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Media enquiries: <!--]--><!--]--><a href="mailto:prteam@evri.com" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->prteam@evri.com<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></section><footer class="post__footer" data-v-e174a07f></footer></article></div></section><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH:"https://www.evri.com",WEB_BASE:"https://www.evri.com/",PRISMIC_REPO:"ev-mercury",DEVTOOLS:false,API_BASE:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/",AUTH0_USERS_ENDPOINT:"https://hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com/userinfo",AUTH0_CLIENT_ID:"dC8K22keYtRszHe7dnmlWSve2kP7mUBF",AUTH0_DOMAIN:"hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com",AUTH0_LOGIN_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",AUTH0_LOGOUT_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",ASSETLINKS_PATH:"assetlinks-prod.json",APPLE_MERCHANT_DOMAIN_PATH:"apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association-PROD.txt",APPLE_APP_SITE_ASSOCIATION_PATH:"apple-app-site-association-PROD",CHATBOT_URL:"https://chat-loader.smartagent.app/loader/main.js",FEATURE_SWITCH_URL:"https://www.evri.com/feature-switches/feature-switches.json",FINDER_URL:"https://location-finder.evri.com",BASKET_API_KEY:"4GuiGkQaE92687ICJtKNRd01hc4JBKUG",BULK_API_KEY:"WtuYb1yZMIGwLJzEm0yUzhLzPGuKS632",EVRI_API_KEY:"0DExZiK9in2ihGce7cDPrnpQ4s4nIpWG",HELP_API_KEY:"IfhFrxnv1JmbNW2tBA9hnRvG1o1vnsx2",SEND_API_KEY:"fHbmtsuSHrBH5gaC6m2QF9QG3YAycmgN",TRACK_NON_ROTATING_API_KEY:"MgMPMhWhXxSp7xIoYUVnWDklTl7EXAgG",GLOBAL_CSS_URI:"https://resources.hermescloud.co.uk/global/",ROUTER_BASE:"/",ACCOUNT_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/enterprise-