DATA__">[["ShallowReactive",1],{"prerenderedAt":2,"data":3,"state":132,"once":13436,"_errors":13437,"serverRendered":83,"path":13439,"pinia":13440},1784019852548,["ShallowReactive",4],{"news:ai-and-automation-at-evri":5},{"uid":6,"document":7,"postSlices":31,"firstPublicationDate":131},"ai-and-automation-at-evri",{"title":8,"category":9,"featuredImage":10,"canonical":9,"metaDescription":28,"titleTag":29,"publishedDate":30,"slices":31},"AI & automation at Evri",null,{"dimensions":11,"alt":14,"copyright":9,"url":15,"id":16,"edit":17,"thumbnail":21},{"width":12,"height":13},960,640,"A woman wearing an orange blazer is sitting at a desk in front of an open laptop, holding a tablet and pressing the screen with her other hand. There are digitalized symbols in white overlaying the photo to show she is using AI technology","ai-and-automation-at-evri.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGvByUMqNJQqHmbo_ConsumerusingAI.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=960&h=640","aGvByUMqNJQqHmbo",{"x":18,"y":18,"zoom":19,"background":20},0,1,"transparent",{"dimensions":22,"alt":14,"copyright":9,"url":25,"id":16,"edit":26},{"width":23,"height":24},384,182,"ai-and-automation-at-evri.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGvByUMqNJQqHmbo_ConsumerusingAI.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C785%2C6000%2C2844&w=384&h=182",{"x":18,"y":27,"zoom":19,"background":20},785,"Read here about Evri's £1m investment in automation and its dedicated page to share updates about the journey so far","AI & Automation at Evri","2025-07-08",[32,71,98],{"variation":33,"version":34,"items":35,"primary":37,"id":69,"slice_type":70,"slice_label":9},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[36],{},{"content":38},[39,54,57,66],{"type":40,"text":41,"spans":42,"direction":53},"paragraph","After Evri’s announcement in 2024 about a £1m investment in automation, we’re pleased to introduce you to our new ⁠AI & automation page that will share updates about our journey so far, some highlights on what has been achieved, and how it benefits our clients, customers, couriers and colleagues. We will be providing regular updates to this page as we continue to safely navigate new ways of operating with the enhanced offering that AI brings to our business.",[43,51],{"start":44,"end":45,"type":46,"data":47},115,135,"hyperlink",{"link_type":48,"url":49,"target":50},"Web","ai-and-automation-at-evri.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fai-and-automation","_blank",{"start":44,"end":45,"type":52},"strong","ltr",{"type":40,"text":55,"spans":56,"direction":53},"We have recruited an internal automation centre of excellence team, that focuses on supporting Evri to deliver key priorities using technologies to automate repetitive and high-volume tasks, building low-code applications to improve speed to market, and we’re also responsible for exploring advanced AI technologies as we look to continue our journey as the biggest dedicated parcel delivery company.",[],{"type":40,"text":58,"spans":59,"direction":53},"The team has provided significant business benefits and supports our Delivering Better campaign, comprising initiatives focusing on operational excellence, transforming operations and, specifically, improving customer experience (our most successful automation – customer service response and wrap-up).",[60,65],{"start":61,"end":62,"type":46,"data":63},263,300,{"link_type":48,"url":64,"target":50},"ai-and-automation-at-evri.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews\u002Fcustomer-service-response-and-wrap-up-use-case",{"start":61,"end":62,"type":52},{"type":40,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":53},"With the ever-changing AI market, we have put a robust governance and framework wrap around anything we are looking at connected with AI. We have mobilised an AI forum, which consists of key representation from architecture, service, security, data, innovation, automation and legal, which provides us with the assurance that anything we are exploring has the necessary support from across key business areas. We have created our AI policy, and this is at the forefront of any new idea that comes through the new ideas stage. Lastly, we have created an AI register to ensure we have a central location for everything we are exploring, implementing and building across the various business areas.",[],"rich_text$7b77841a-312c-4f6b-abcc-adc0e041476a","rich_text",{"variation":33,"version":34,"items":72,"primary":73,"id":96,"slice_type":97,"slice_label":9},[],{"title":74,"bodyText":75,"isEco":82,"PaddingTop":83,"PaddingBottom":83,"NoMarginBottom":82,"hasButton":83,"buttonText":84,"buttonLink":85,"image":88},"AI and automation",[76,79],{"type":40,"text":77,"spans":78,"direction":53},"We're safely implementing AI to deliver better for our people, customers, clients and couriers.",[],{"type":40,"text":80,"spans":81,"direction":53},"Check out the latest news and updates about exciting projects we've been working on and more.",[],false,true,"Find out more",{"link_type":48,"key":86,"url":87},"d13c1177-21d8-4c8b-ad97-df211d75ce72","\u002Fai-and-automation",{"dimensions":89,"alt":92,"copyright":9,"url":93,"id":94,"edit":95},{"width":90,"height":91},1000,667,"A human and robot index finger are shown to meet in the middle of the photo","ai-and-automation-at-evri.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq_AIhumancollaboration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C4996%2C3332&w=1000&h=667","aGvBzEMqNJQqHmbq",{"x":19,"y":18,"zoom":19,"background":20},"feature_banner$13ba971b-4085-4d38-a62b-011ccfadec28","feature_banner",{"variation":33,"version":34,"items":99,"primary":100,"id":130,"slice_type":70,"slice_label":9},[],{"content":101},[102,105,110,112,117,119,128],{"type":40,"text":103,"spans":104,"direction":53},"",[],{"type":40,"text":106,"spans":107,"direction":53},"– End –",[108],{"start":18,"end":109,"type":52},7,{"type":40,"text":103,"spans":111,"direction":53},[],{"type":40,"text":113,"spans":114,"direction":53},"Evri is one of the UK’s dedicated parcel delivery company, delivering more than 800 million parcels a year. The company has a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth. Evri works with most of Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites. The roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974 but the business has grown over the decades and now has a team of 8,000+ employees, 25,000+ couriers, 10,000+ out of home locations and a growing network of state-of-the-art hubs and depots. Evri has more than 3 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, on-time delivery rates which surpass 99%, an average courier rating of 4.7\u002F5, and a commitment to provide an answer for everyone following a significant investment in customer experience.",[115],{"start":18,"end":116,"type":52},4,{"type":40,"text":103,"spans":118,"direction":53},[],{"type":40,"text":120,"spans":121,"direction":53},"Media enquiries: prteam@evri.com",[122,127],{"start":123,"end":124,"type":46,"data":125},17,32,{"link_type":48,"url":126,"target":50},"mailto:prteam@evri.com",{"start":123,"end":124,"type":52},{"type":40,"text":103,"spans":129,"direction":53},[],"rich_text$65a93a8b-d946-4b5f-8626-0f2b067b876f","2025-07-03T11:05:26+0000",["Reactive",133],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":134,"$sclients":200,"$sglobal-basket-count":9},{"abtasty":135,"accessibe":138,"appPromoBanner":141,"autoDivertUpdates":144,"awin":147,"bulkInternational":150,"bulkSendEnabled":153,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":156,"enableBasketCount":159,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":162,"euCustomsDuty":165,"groovyAdvert":168,"newInternationalSendFlow":171,"newinternationalpages":178,"oohPreferenceFlag":182,"opentel":185,"premium":188,"savedCards":191,"smallParcelSize":194,"yourPricesDrawer":197},{"_createdAt":136,"_updatedAt":137,"enabled":83},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":139,"_updatedAt":140,"enabled":83},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":1